 copy and verification. Rclone applies depth filtering to `check` too. The root manifest still passes verification, so Line 329 reports `archived` for an incomplete bundle. ([rclone.org](https://rclone.org/commands/rclone_check/))\n\nRemove inherited file-selection options from the subprocess environment, while retaining required remote configuration and credentials.","id":"de01eaf318a192e257e26bff6b24239febb1c819dc3677779cb5e9da547e3d9e","intervals":[[86,86]],"path":"scripts/archive-measurement-wrapper.mjs","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Prevent inherited rclone filters from hiding bundle files."},{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"56cf3dc87396a3027bdba6547777ad12b889f41b","body":"**Escape Markdown syntax in untrusted text.**\n\nAt `scripts/measurement-rollup.mjs:128`, `md()` leaves `![evidence](remote.png)` unchanged. An accepted artifact reference therefore becomes an image instead of literal text under CommonMark. ([spec.commonmark.org](https://spec.commonmark.org/0.31.2/?utm_source=openai)) This violates the file's inert-text contract. Escape Markdown metacharacters, existing backslashes and HTML delimiters before inserting text.","id":"9f172a954b9f6174e894627f8579ff1c9c0316ee7158b77af39fecc3dd29ff30","intervals":[[128,128]],"path":"scripts/measurement-rollup.mjs","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Escape Markdown syntax in untrusted text."}],"head":"7b88be236be9da2b6daa11bd9ee68f8c0fdbc233","head_tree":"40cca612920bd0f60b7d7ded61025db433bf3a2a","input_scope":[{"blob":"f5a6d2331b7b3a6bbbab68fa4b482d52b98c7e72","intervals":[[1,29]],"path":"scripts/archive-measurement-wrapper.d.mts"},{"blob":"2b39d15cc823967aa07a4f0ec7cd520bc4240520","intervals":[[1,360]],"path":"scripts/archive-measurement-wrapper.mjs"},{"blob":"56cf3dc87396a3027bdba6547777ad12b889f41b","intervals":[[1,262]],"path":"scripts/measurement-rollup.mjs"}],"job_id":"ca0d2c069ab2da1d4ef89d27708e7eb6a575a360459b1720b446d0ef65b0f73f:0","ou